### POST 로그인 -> JWT 토큰 발급
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "dev01",
  "password": "dev01!!!"
}

> {% client.global.set("authToken", response.body.token) %}

### GET 유저 정보 조회 요청
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/userinfo
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

